        "n0025",
        "n0027",
        "n0030",
        "n0034"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-mnsz9f",
        "spya-g73szb"
      ],
      "title": "Phrenology and Self-Knowledge",
      "gist": "Phrenology reveals the mind's separate faculties, giving self-knowledge and insight into others, and explains why people's characters and abilities differ."
    },
    "n0025": {
      "id": "n0025",
      "depth": 3,
      "parent": "n0024",
      "children": [
        "n0026"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-mnsz9f",
        "spya-mnsz9f"
      ],
      "title": "Advantages of Phrenology",
      "gist": "Phrenology offers many practical benefits, from self-knowledge and self-government to guidance in vocation, family life, and moral improvement."
    },
    "n0026": {
      "id": "n0026",
      "depth": 4,
      "parent": "n0025",
      "children": [],
      "range": [
        "spya-mnsz9f",
        "spya-mnsz9f"
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    "n0027": {
      "id": "n0027",
      "depth": 3,
      "parent": "n0024",
      "children": [
        "n0028",
        "n0029"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-v36sfm",
        "spya-ceaznc"
      ],
      "title": "Mind as Distinct Faculties",
      "gist": "Phrenology shows that the mind, like the body, consists of distinct powers manifested through the brain, and understanding our own tendencies lets us guard against excess and improve ourselves."
    },
    "n0028": {
      "id": "n0028",
      "depth": 4,
      "parent": "n0027",
      "children": [],
      "range": [
        "spya-v36sfm",
