        "n0033"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-f0nqp5",
        "spya-mk80vj"
      ],
      "title": "Understanding Others' Character",
      "gist": "Knowing phrenology also helps us understand others, as illustrated by a badly balanced convict, giving those who grasp mental and bodily laws a real advantage in life."
    },
