        "n0036"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-vkneu2",
        "spya-g73szb"
      ],
      "title": "Explaining Human Diversity",
      "gist": "Though all people share the same faculties and bodily structures, differences in their quality and activity produce the great diversity of character among men, which Physiology and Phrenology together explain."
    },
